        </dl>
        <div class="mt-4 grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-4 text-micro">
          <span class="text-dim">Skills</span>
          <span class="text-muted">[TODO Unity, C#, AI, Blender, JavaScript, Python, AR, VR, Design Systems]</span>
